    <div id="mainContent">
            <p class="Division"><a name="10.10.50"></a>Division 10-10.50:<br />Effective Date</p>


            <p class="digCH">Sections:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff10/Flagstaff1010050.html#10.10.50.010">10-10.50.010</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Effective Date</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="10.10.50.010"><a name="10.10.50.010">10-10.50.010</a> Effective Date</h3>
            <p class="P0">This Zoning Code is hereby enacted as the zoning ordinance for the City, and shall be effective as of 12:01 a.m., December 5, 2011, unless this Zoning Code is referred to a vote of the people, in which case it will take effect, if at all, 10 days after the election approving its adoption. </p>

            <p class="HistoryNote">(Ord. 2016-07, Amended, 2/16/2016 (Res. 2016-02))</p>

    </div>
